From: z23 <3616196+z23@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] vaapi_h264: explicit admission stop without Baseline/Extended remap

Local patch against FFmpeg n9.0.1 bf1b838f2ab88b4f8fd83443325c782ea0e0f7fa
for omarchy-m1-video#79. Not installed and not sent upstream.

Includes internal.h so AVCodecInternal is complete. Keeps profile map
without Baseline/Extended. decode_nal_units cancels DPA/DPB/DPC and
slice/hwaccel failures before issue. end_frame refuses empty sessions.

